  "body": "It seems like it's impossible to resolve a Windows file:/// URI with a base.\r\n\r\nExpected (as implemented Chrome):\r\n```js\r\nnew URL('/c:/foo/bar', 'file:///c:/baz/qux').href\r\n\"file:///C:/foo/bar\"\r\n```\r\n\r\nActual (as implemented in jsdom/whatwg-url, NodeJS 7, Edge):\r\n```js\r\nnew URL('/c:/foo/bar', 'file:///c:/baz/qux').href\r\n'file:///c:/c:/foo/bar'\r\n```",
